# Review fix work

- The spec is `aidocs/implementation-plan.md`; findings and rationale are in `aidocs/review.md`.
  If they disagree, the implementation plan wins.
- Work phase by phase, task by task, in the order given. Do not start a phase before the
  previous phase gate (§1.2 of the plan) passes.
- One commit per task ID on branch `review-fixes`; subject starts with the IDs.
- Write the test first and confirm it fails on the old code when the task has a "Test" line.
- Never guess a design decision that is not in the plan: add it to "Open questions" at the
  bottom of the plan and move on.
- Do not rename existing metrics or console verbs (list in plan §0 rule 4).
